rrange a viewing and secure your dream home. Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: TBC PARKING Ask agent GARDEN Ask agent ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy Performance Certificate Utilities, rights & restrictions Brigadier Walk, London, SE18 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Benham & Reeves - Woolwich, Woolwich 3 Victory Parade, Plumstead Road, London, SE18 6FL Industry affiliations: Woolwich Letting Agents From our branch at Royal Arsenal Riverside, a highly popular new-build property development situated next door to Woolwich Elizabeth Line underground station, our ARLA Propertymark trained lettings staff keep their fingers on the pulse of the thriving local rental property market. Our team manage a large register of premium properties for rental with a specialism in professional lettings and new-build property management. We offer landlords wherever in the world they are based, a full lettings and property management service as well as furnishing packages for rental properties. Our rental property register covers Woolwich, Dulwich and Plumstead, the SE18 and SE19 postcodes. With a London-wide branch network and via our international offices, we have an extensive database and constant flow of global buyers interested in Woolwich and nearby postcodes. We also provide a comprehensive buying and selling service to local homeowners, buy-to-let and rental investors. • Company established in 1958 • Woolwich branch on-site at Royal Arsenal Riverside since 2021 • Members of ARLA Propertymark, the NAEA, The Property Ombudsman & The TDS • Japan and China Desks with multi-lingual staff • International offices in China, Hong Kong, India, Indonesia, Malaysia, Middle East, Singapore, Taiwan, Thailand & Turkey • Property Lettings & Sales via 21 London branches including prime London locations. Read more Vie